Limitations
- Completion is not validity: this run cannot support inferential claims.
- Failed cells and budget overruns remain in the evidence; no selective rerun,
  threshold change, or post hoc censoring was applied.
- Both models share OpenCode Go, so provider effects and cross-provider
  generalization are not identified.
- Catalog listings are not immutable serving-weight hashes, and the provider
  exposes no unified sampling seed.
- A new independently frozen replication is required before testing the main
  hypothesis again; v0.29 must remain unchanged as failed evidence.
